{"c":[{"id":"c23945751b6b1fca","sum":"live_bytes is the union of persistent block ids, ids below 0 dropped. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T220226Z-0a3553df5a1ac252","text":"2026-10-23: warehouse-file-growth at 36b3c4d is main plus the memory bank. Milestone 4 doctor storage report passed preflight with an advisory. live_bytes stays the union of persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Build has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T224558Z-a0c4edb3a448542b","text":"argparse's default help formatter replaces a space with a newline, so a two-word --help assertion can fail. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"54a433b5bbf07253","sum":"copy_warehouse leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261024T001536Z-49fa9d2f5324eb68","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 4 doctor storage report is checked after reflect. Milestone 5 verified newer-format copy is Level 3. Plan has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261024T002339Z-883a096b1bb38717","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 5 plan writes copy_warehouse, which leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions. Preflight has not run.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
